  "title": "Mexican Street Corn Dip",
  "description": "This Mexican street corn dip recipe is made with canned corn, yogurt, lime, cotija cheese, and cilantro. Chili powder, cumin, and jalapeño add spice.",
  "authors": [
    "Amanda Uher"
